      "value": "(off-topic)\n\n@{687c1606c1f0e1f01658827d|full_name} The comments here are contributing to off-topic discussion, and are not related to fixing the issue reported in OP on this developer platform. See the [VRChat Ask](https://ask.vrchat.com/) forum is for questions. For user support, see https://vrch.at/support.\n\nTo answer to your actual question: You wait for VRChat to update their source code fork of yt-dlp with their security changes, and update it for you. The VRChat client checks for yt-dlp updates (`Debug      -  [Behaviour] checking for youtube-dl updates`) when you switch worlds/instances.",
